From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:54:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Enable the Allwinner A733 USB2 PHY of the
 USB3 controller

The USB3 DRD controller of the Allwinner A733 needs its own USB 2.0 PHY
to leave reset. Enable its driver as a module.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the kernel builds the
driver as a module, and modprobe phy-sun60i-a733-usb2 succeeds.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 271ccabfc378..45b1186374a9 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1760,6 +1760,7 @@ CONFIG_PHY_NXP_PTN3222=m
 CONFIG_PHY_SNPS_EUSB2=m
 CONFIG_PHY_XGENE=y
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN4I_USB=y
+CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_USB2=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_TORRENT=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_DPHY=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_DPHY_RX=m
